  "translation": "Na sɛ ɔhene no rebɛtow a, ɔtee atrɔ kyerɛɛ ɔhene no, na ɔkaa sɛ: “Wo akɔdi no yɛɛ nea ɔkɔɔ ɔko ano mfimfini, na hwɛ, onipa bi dane ho kɔɔ, na onipa bi baa me nkyɛn, na ɔkaa sɛ: Bɔ ⟨את⟩ onipa yi ho ban — sɛ ɔyera a, wunankasa wun kra bɛsi ne kra anan, anaasɛ wobɛtua sikakɔkɔɔ kɔkɔɔ baako.”",
